    {
        "name": "Evan's Syndrome",
        "name_ja": "エバンズ症候群",
        "symptoms": {
            "lethargy",
            "fever",
            "rapid_breathing",
            "skin_redness",
        },
        "description": "Simultaneous or sequential autoimmune destruction of both erythrocytes (IMHA) and platelets (ITP), causing life-threatening combined anemia and hemorrhage.",
        "description_ja": "IMHA（免疫介在性溶血性貧血）＋ITP（免疫介在性血小板減少症）の同時発症→重度貧血＋出血傾向→DIC・血栓塞栓症リスク。IMHA単独より予後不良（致死率40-70%）。",
        "pathophysiology": "Simultaneous or sequential development of autoantibodies against erythrocyte (IMHA) and platelet (ITP) surface antigens. IMHA component: IgG and/or IgM autoantibodies bind to RBC membrane antigens (often ankyrin, band 3, glycophorin C-like epitopes) -> Fc receptor-mediated phagocytosis in spleen (IgG extravascular hemolysis) + complement-mediated intravascular hemolysis (IgM -> MAC formation -> RBC lysis -> hemoglobinemia/uria). ITP component: IgG anti-platelet antibodies (targets GPIIb/IIIa, GPIb/IX) -> platelet Fc receptor phagocytosis in spleen/liver -> severe thrombocytopenia (<20,000/uL -> spontaneous hemorrhage risk). Combined effect: severe anemia (PCV <15%) + thrombocytopenia -> hemorrhagic anemia -> tissue hypoxia + coagulopathy. DIC risk: thrombocytopenia + anemia + endothelial damage from chronic inflammation + hypoxia-induced thrombophilia -> paradoxical thromboembolism despite thrombocytopenia (PTE most common cause of death in Evans). Primary (idiopathic): anti-Ro/SSA or anti-La/SSB autoantibodies in some dogs (similar to human SLE). Secondary: lymphoma, SLE, drug-induced. Cocker Spaniels, English Springers, Old English Sheepdogs predisposed.",
        "pathophysiology_ja": "免疫介在性溶血性貧血（IMHA）＋免疫介在性血小板減少症（ITP）の同時発症→赤血球と血小板の両方が自己抗体により破壊→重度貧血＋出血傾向の二重苦。IMHA単独よりも予後不良（致死率40-70%）。DIC・血栓塞栓症の合併リスクが極めて高い。",
        "causes": "Idiopathic (primary autoimmune, most common), secondary to lymphoma, SLE, drug-induced (trimethoprim-sulfa, cephalosporins), vaccine-associated (temporal association, debated).",
        "causes_ja": "特発性（一次性自己免疫、最多）、リンパ腫続発性、SLE、薬剤性（トリメトプリム・スルファ、セファロスポリン）、ワクチン関連（時間的関連あり、因果関係は議論中）。",
        "treatment": "Combined ITP + IMHA — treat both simultaneously. Immunosuppression: Prednisone 2 mg/kg PO q12h (2 mg/kg total = 4 mg/kg/day) + Mycophenolate 10 mg/kg PO q12h. Add Azathioprine 2 mg/kg PO q24h (dogs only; hepatotoxicity risk - monitor LFTs). Refractory cases: hIVIG 0.5-1 g/kg IV over 6-8h (Fc receptor blockade + anti-idiotype; expensive). Vincristine 0.02 mg/kg IV (mobilizes bone marrow platelet reserves for ITP component; also use for IMHA - megakaryocyte sensitization). Blood transfusion: pRBC (PCV <15%) despite hemolysis acceleration risk (minimal with immunosuppression started). Platelet-rich plasma rarely indicated (rapidly consumed). Anticoagulation: UFH 200 IU/kg SC q6-8h for PTE prophylaxis (high PTE mortality in Evans). Monitor: PCV, platelet count q12-24h acute phase, Coombs test, D-dimer, troponin. Splenectomy: for refractory IMHA, not ITP alone in Evans.",
        "treatment_ja": "IMHA＋ITPの同時治療。免疫抑制：プレドニゾロン2 mg/kg PO q12h＋ミコフェノール酸モフェチル10 mg/kg PO q12h。難治性：ヒト免疫グロブリン（hIVIG）0.5-1 g/kg IV（Fc受容体遮断）。ビンクリスチン0.02 mg/kg IV（血小板動員・ITP緊急対応）。輸血：PCV<15%で濃厚赤血球（免疫抑制開始後は溶血加速リスク許容範囲）。抗凝固：UFHヘパリン200 IU/kg SC q6-8h（PTE予防：Evans症候群のPTE死亡率は高い）。PCV・血小板数・D-dimer・トロポニンの急性期q12-24hモニタリング。",
        "prognosis": "Poor; mortality 40-70%. Most deaths from PTE, infection (immunosuppression), or uncontrolled hemorrhage. Median survival 6-12 months in responders. Relapses common (40-60%) when immunosuppression reduced.",
        "prognosis_ja": "不良。致死率40-70%。主な死因：PTE、免疫抑制による感染症、難治性出血。治療反応例の生存期間中央値6-12ヶ月。免疫抑制減量時の再発率40-60%。",
        "prevention": "Avoid triggering drugs in susceptible breeds. Monitor CBC for drug-induced hematologic abnormalities.",
        "prevention_ja": "感受性犬種での誘発薬剤（トリメトプリム・セファロスポリン等）の回避。薬物誘発性血液学的異常のCBC定期モニタリング。",
        "recommended_tests": [
            "全血球計算・PCV (CBC + PCV) - anemia severity (PCV), platelet count (<20,000/uL = spontaneous hemorrhage)",
            "直接クームス試験 (Direct Coombs Test) - IgG/IgM RBC coating confirms IMHA",
            "凝固検査 (Coagulation Panel + D-dimer) - DIC/PTE assessment",
            "血液塗抹 (Blood Smear) - spherocytes, agglutination, schistocytes",
            "腹部エコー (Abdominal Ultrasound) - splenomegaly, lymphadenopathy (lymphoma)",
            "血清タンパク分画 (Protein Electrophoresis + ANA) - SLE/lymphoma underlying cause",
        ],
        "urgency": "emergency",
        "onset_pattern": {"acute"},
        "age_predisposition": {"adult", "senior"},
    },
